sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor AD as Admin
    participant UI as React App
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as SQLite
    actor IN as Invited Person

    AD->>UI: Enter email and role
    UI->>API: POST /workspaces/{id}/invites
    API->>API: Check admin role
    API->>DB: Revoke old pending invite, create new token (7 days)
    API-->>UI: Invite with token
    UI-->>AD: Show invite link
    AD->>IN: Share link /invite/{token}
    IN->>UI: Open link, sign up or log in
    UI->>API: GET /invites/{token}
    API-->>UI: Workspace name, role, status
    IN->>UI: Click Join
    UI->>API: POST /invites/{token}/accept
    API->>API: Check pending, not expired, email matches
    API->>DB: Add member, mark invite accepted
    API-->>UI: Workspace with role
    UI-->>IN: Open workspace dashboard
